---
description: Handheld Game Forge branding and IP guardrails for generated games and docs.
alwaysApply: false
globs:
  - "**/*.{c,h,md,txt}"
---

When working in a Handheld Game Forge game project:

- Say handheld, GBC-class, `.gbc`, or `.gba` – never console manufacturer trademarks or classic handheld product brand names.
- Keep public/arcade builds original (`isFanDemake: false`). Homage refs stay in `refs-locked/` only.
- Use en dashes (–) in prose, never em dashes.
- Never commit API tokens or unlock secrets.
